{"type":"text","timestamp":1794652241089,"sessionID":"ses_e2664f1aeffe9y62wg3QJH9bd4","part":{"id":"prt_1d99bea860017n4dFrCELVZOG6","messageID":"msg_1d99be3c90017GYvGFlJXM2wSU","sessionID":"ses_e2664f1aeffe9y62wg3QJH9bd4","type":"text","text":"The function works correctly:\n- Returns `None` for correct entries\n- Returns error with \"range\" for wrong count\n- Returns error with \"chain\" for broken chain\n- Returns error with \"head\" for wrong head\n\nAll existing tests pass. The implementation is complete.","time":{"start":1794652236422,"end":1794652241080}}}
